Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-yaml, openvpn (>= 2.5), easy-rsa, unbound, nftables, conntrack, openssl, iproute2, ca-certificates, systemd
Suggests: suricata, suricata-update
Description: TestOps Gate - OpenVPN private network with a terminal dashboard
 TestOps Gate sets up an OpenVPN server and manages it from a terminal
 dashboard (`testops-gate`) or the command line:
  * VPN users with fixed addresses, per-user split or full tunnel
  * internal DNS host records (Unbound)
  * per-user session, DNS and connection logs with retention
  * security monitoring (port scans, blocked networks, forbidden ports,
    malicious domains, Suricata IDS) with Slack and email alerts
